process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary host_auth ⟦
        rule safety ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    reasoning_chain host_log with host_auth ⟦ capacity ↦ 20 · ⟧

    ethical_boundary untrusted_auth_a ⟦
        rule tool_safety ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    ethical_boundary untrusted_auth_b ⟦
        rule tool_safety ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    sandbox_create sandbox_a with untrusted_auth_a ⟦ capacity ↦ 10 · ⟧
    sandbox_create sandbox_b with untrusted_auth_b ⟦ capacity ↦ 10 · ⟧

    tool_register safe_tool with untrusted_auth_a pre ⟦ 1 ⟧ post ⟦ 1 ⟧ ·

    sandbox_run sandbox_a ⦅ safe_tool⦅"trigger_violation"⦆ ⦆ ·
    sandbox_run sandbox_b ⦅ safe_tool⦅"valid_arg"⦆ ⦆ ·

    text att_a ↦ sandbox_verify sandbox_a ·
    text att_b ↦ sandbox_verify sandbox_b ·

    emit "SANDBOX_A_ATTESTATION:" ·
    emit att_a ·
    emit "SANDBOX_B_ATTESTATION:" ·
    emit att_b ·

    emit "ISOLATION_CONFIRMED: Host survives, Sandbox A violated, Sandbox B clean" ·

    yield 0 ·
⟧
